# Order Service HTTP Examples

## Создание нового заказа

POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "userId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 450.00
    },
    {
      "bookId": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 380.00
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "г. Москва, ул. Пушкина, д. 10"
}
```

### Response 201 Created
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "NEW",
  "totalAmount": 1280.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "bookId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 450.00,
      "subtotal": 900.00
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "bookId": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 380.00,
      "subtotal": 380.00
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "г. Москва, ул. Пушкина, д. 10",
  "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:30:00",
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T12:30:00"
}
```

### Response 400 Bad Request
```json
{
  "error": "Insufficient stock for book id=1"
}
```

---

## Получение заказа по ID

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "NEW",
  "totalAmount": 1280.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "bookId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 450.00,
      "subtotal": 900.00
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "bookId": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 380.00,
      "subtotal": 380.00
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": "г. Москва, ул. Пушкина, д. 10",
  "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:30:00",
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T12:30:00"
}
```

---

## Получение заказа по номеру

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/number/ORD-2025-06-04-001
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "NEW",
  "totalAmount": 1280.00,
  "items": [...]
}
```

---

## Получение заказов пользователя

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/user/1
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
    "userId": 1,
    "status": "NEW",
    "totalAmount": 1280.00,
    "createdAt": "2025-06-04T12:30:00"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-03-001",
    "userId": 1,
    "status": "DELIVERED",
    "totalAmount": 850.00,
    "createdAt": "2025-06-03T10:15:00"
  }
]
```

---

