## Обновление статуса заказа (по ID)

PUT http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "status": "PROCESSING"
}
```

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "PROCESSING",
  "totalAmount": 1280.00,
  "items": [...],
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T13:00:00"
}
```

---

## Обновление статуса заказа (по номеру)

PUT http://localhost:8082/api/orders/number/ORD-2025-06-04-001/status
Content-Type: application/json

```json
{
  "status": "DELIVERED"
}
```

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-2025-06-04-001",
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "totalAmount": 1280.00,
  "items": [...],
  "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T14:00:00"
}
```

---

## Отмена заказа

DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/orders/1?reason=Client%20requested%20cancellation
Accept: application/json

### Response 204 No Content

---

## Получение общей статистики заказов

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/statistics
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "totalOrders": 150,
  "totalRevenue": 450000.00,
  "ordersByStatus": {
    "NEW": 25,
    "PROCESSING": 30,
    "DELIVERED": 80,
    "CANCELLED": 15
  },
  "averageOrderValue": 3000.00
}
```

---

## Получение статистики пользователя

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/user/1/statistics
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "userId": 1,
  "totalOrders": 10,
  "totalSpent": 15000.00,
  "ordersByStatus": {
    "NEW": 2,
    "DELIVERED": 8
  },
  "lastOrderDate": "2025-06-04T12:30:00"
}
```

