## Health Check

GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/health
Accept: application/json

### Response 200 OK
```json
{
  "status": "UP",
  "service": "order-service"
}
```

---

## Prometheus Metrics

GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/prometheus

### Response 200 OK (пример метрик)
```
http_server_requests_seconds_count{method="POST",status="201",uri="/api/orders",} 50
http_server_requests_seconds_sum{method="POST",status="201",uri="/api/orders",} 2.345
```
